<title>czech republic: ICE HOCKEY-CZECH REPUBLIC BEAT NORWAY IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-CZECH REPUBLIC BEAT NORWAY IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>MLADA BOLESLAV, Czech Republic 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech</p>
<p>Republic beat Norway 4-2 (0-0 3-1 1-1) in an ice hockey friendly</p>
<p>on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Czech Republic - Libor Prochazka (25), Vladimir Vujtek (25),</p>
<p>Martin Prochazka (29, 46)</p>
<p>Norway - Marius Trygg (31), Paul Johnsen (53)</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,000.</p>
</text>
